{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30128","headline":"莺出谷 · 刘得仁","name":"莺出谷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东风潜啓物，动息意皆新。\n此鸟从幽谷，依林报早春。\n出寒虽未及，振羽渐能频。\n稍类冲天鹤，多随折桂人。\n尊前喧有语，花里昼藏身。\n若向穠华处，余禽不见亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘得仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30128.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30128","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}